<title>USA: Frisch's Q1 to continue growth trend.</title>
<headline>Frisch's Q1 to continue growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>In a proxy solicitation letter to be mailed Wednesday to shareholders of Frisch's Restaurants Inc, Board Chairman Jack Maier asks for continued support and states that earnings for the first quarter will reflect the third straight quarter of earnings improvement.</p>
<p>The company's first quarter ended September 22.</p>
</text>
